    "body": "Adds a production-ready authenticated job details page as the central lifecycle hub for doFast jobs.\n\nHighlights:\n- full job status and lifecycle presentation\n- role-aware actions for requester and worker\n- route, chat, dispute and review entry points\n- participant and timeline sections\n- responsive styling\n- links from job discovery and My Jobs\n\nThis builds directly on the A-to-B routing/live tracking work in `2ebe892b` and avoids duplicating backend lifecycle logic.",
